{"skill":{"slug":"ai-notes-of-video","displayName":"AI Notes of Video"},"version":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1770275533347,"changelog":"- Initial release of ai-notes-of-video skill.\n- Generate three types of AI notes (document, outline, image-text) from user-provided video URLs using Baidu’s API.\n- Added workflow and API usage to create and query note generation tasks.\n- Requires BAIDU_API_KEY to be set in environment.\n- Detailed documentation included for setup, parameters, and note types.","changelogSource":"user","license":null,"files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":2872,"sha256":"fb93f4ea36a3fdd5d6bf13a4e627b55072c1947e1d8cb37004025d58cb8ebd6c","contentType":null},{"path":"scripts/ai_notes_task_create.py","size":1177,"sha256":"f7e4c06065220e563764f6f9d9daac234009c3ea097c77af300d67edf189f50d","contentType":"text/x-python-script"},{"path":"scripts/ai_notes_task_query.py","size":1171,"sha256":"d6a20bf08786795592a45a3b286919f3125b700576e61f8a1aec179464f49355","contentType":"text/x-python-script"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2015,"sha256":"d6409809bbbaa4c91c98d1ebcb213b3e902ef9b726d20550e5ff80b025e6b332","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789034129916,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"e16ae844a30c3efb7faa8ea1c8a0e375f320bcf9b1d21fa1fb1b2784013b1809","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/e16ae844a30c3efb7faa8ea1c8a0e375f320bcf9b1d21fa1fb1b2784013b1809","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":"Type: OpenClaw Skill\nName: ai-notes-of-video\nVersion: 1.0.0\n\nThe skill is designed to interact with the Baidu AI notes API to create and query video notes. The Python scripts (`scripts/ai_notes_task_create.py`, `scripts/ai_notes_task_query.py`) make legitimate API calls to `https://qianfan.baidubce.com` using a `BAIDU_API_KEY` from environment variables and user-provided video URLs or task IDs. There is no evidence of data exfiltration, malicious execution, persistence mechanisms, prompt injection attempts against the agent, or obfuscation. All actions are aligned with the stated purpose of generating AI notes from videos.","source":"palm","checkedAt":1779161471441},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":34,"severity":"MEDIUM","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":6,"checkedAt":1789034129916},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This skill does what it claims: it sends a user-provided video URL to Baidu's AI-notes API and queries the result, with no hidden persistence or local data access found.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Use of BAIDU_API_KEY and outbound calls to qianfan.baidubce.com are proportionate for a Baidu API integration, though users should understand that submitted video URLs are processed by Baidu.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The skill declares Python and BAIDU_API_KEY requirements only; no package installation, shell setup, tool replacement, or remote code loading is present.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The workflow is mostly clear, but the documentation has naming mistakes such as 'AI PPT Generation,' 'PPTOutlineGenerate API,' and an incorrect query-script usage string.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"note"},{"detail":"No file writes, credential storage, background workers, scheduled tasks, privilege escalation, or persistence mechanisms were found.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The stated purpose is generating AI notes from a user-provided video URL, and the scripts implement only Baidu task creation and task-result query calls for that workflow.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Install only if you are comfortable sending video URLs and referenced video content to Baidu's Qianfan service using your BAIDU_API_KEY. Avoid internal, signed, private, or sensitive media URLs unless that data sharing is approved.","findings":"[SQP-2] expected: The URL is sent to Baidu for processing, which is central to the skill's stated function; disclosure could be clearer but the Baidu provider and API-key requirement are visible in the artifact.\n[E1] expected: The external requests.post call is the documented task-create API call to Baidu, not an unrelated or hidden transmission.\n[SDI-4] unexpected: The PPT/query usage labels are real documentation inconsistencies, but they do not add hidden authority or change the implemented behavior.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789034129916}}}}}